{"id":"2097b8cb05c03724","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-set11-function-space-code.md","title":"ZFC Set11 Function Space Code","display":"df-zfc-set11-function-space-code — ZFC Set11 Function Space Code","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set11-function-space-code","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set11-function-space-code"],"display":"df-zfc-set11-function-space-code — ZFC Set11 Function Space Code","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set11-function-space-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set11-function-space-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set11-function-space-code — ZFC Set11 Function Space Code"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> (sets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> (candidate function-space code)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-coded function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet11FunctionSpaceCode}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet11FunctionSpaceCode}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set11\\text{-}function\\text{-}space\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet11FunctionSpaceCode}_S(F,A,B)\n\\leftrightarrow\nF=\n\\left\\{\nf\\in\\mathcal P(A\\times B):\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set11\\text{-}function\\text{-}space\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet11FunctionSpaceCode}_S(F,A,B)\n\\leftrightarrow\nF=\n\\left\\{\nf\\in\\mathcal P(A\\times B):\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Domain and range conditions alone allow multivalued relations; the upstream function predicate now enforces totality and uniqueness.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-coded function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet11FunctionSpaceCode}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set11\\text{-}function\\text{-}space\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet11FunctionSpaceCode}_S(F,A,B)\n\\leftrightarrow\nF=\n\\left\\{\nf\\in\\mathcal P(A\\times B):\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\n\\right\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":992,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3408","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-set11-function-space-code.md|58-df-zfc-set11-function-space-code]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751"]}